{"page":58,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"50","words":[{"text":"50","x":212,"y":138,"width":51,"height":35}]},{"text":"CHAPTER 01 • 컴퓨터 네트위크와 인터넷","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":606,"y":144,"width":127,"height":26},{"text":"01","x":745,"y":145,"width":30,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":810,"y":151,"width":13,"height":12},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":855,"y":143,"width":75,"height":30},{"text":"네트위크와","x":943,"y":144,"width":133,"height":29},{"text":"인터넷","x":1086,"y":143,"width":77,"height":29}]},{"text":"전달한다. 여기서, 캡슐화의 반1기과정이 시작된다. 1기1일름은 사내 끼대서 밥에","words":[{"text":"전달한다.","x":582,"y":270,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"여기서,","x":743,"y":271,"width":107,"height":37},{"text":"캡슐화의","x":868,"y":270,"width":130,"height":38},{"text":"반1기과정이","x":1016,"y":270,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"시작된다.","x":1202,"y":269,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"1기1일름은","x":1361,"y":269,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"사내","x":1514,"y":271,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"끼대서","x":1721,"y":272,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"밥에","x":1836,"y":275,"width":60,"height":42}]},{"text":"게 전달하고 밥은 사내 청-투에서 메모를 꺼낸다.","words":[{"text":"게","x":580,"y":329,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"전달하고","x":627,"y":330,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"밥은","x":775,"y":330,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"사내","x":854,"y":329,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"청-투에서","x":932,"y":330,"width":132,"height":37},{"text":"메모를","x":1081,"y":330,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"꺼낸다.","x":1197,"y":326,"width":107,"height":40}]},{"text":"캡슐화 과정은 위에서 기술한 것보다 더 복잡할 수 있다. 예를 들어, 큰 메시지는","words":[{"text":"캡슐화","x":647,"y":389,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"과정은","x":761,"y":390,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"위에서","x":878,"y":389,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"기술한","x":995,"y":389,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"것보다","x":1112,"y":387,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"더","x":1228,"y":387,"width":27,"height":38},{"text":"복잡할","x":1274,"y":387,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1392,"y":387,"width":35,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1444,"y":388,"width":75,"height":39},{"text":"예를","x":1538,"y":390,"width":70,"height":38},{"text":"들어,","x":1623,"y":390,"width":78,"height":38},{"text":"큰","x":1719,"y":393,"width":34,"height":35},{"text":"메시지는","x":1769,"y":391,"width":129,"height":45}]},{"text":"여러 개의 트랜스포트 계층 세그먼트로 분할될 수 있디(또한 그들 각각은 여러 개의","words":[{"text":"여러","x":577,"y":449,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"개의","x":662,"y":449,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"트랜스포트","x":745,"y":449,"width":169,"height":36},{"text":"계층","x":933,"y":448,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"세그먼트로","x":1015,"y":447,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"분할될","x":1201,"y":447,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"수","x":1320,"y":448,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"있디(또한","x":1374,"y":447,"width":152,"height":40},{"text":"그들","x":1542,"y":452,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"각각은","x":1630,"y":451,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"여러","x":1753,"y":451,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"개의","x":1837,"y":455,"width":58,"height":43}]},{"text":"네트워크 계층 데이터그램으로 분할될 수 있다). 그러고 나서 수신 측에서 각 세그먼트","words":[{"text":"네트워크","x":576,"y":508,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"계층","x":725,"y":508,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"데이터그램으로","x":805,"y":507,"width":236,"height":38},{"text":"분할될","x":1054,"y":506,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1168,"y":507,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"있다).","x":1217,"y":507,"width":86,"height":38},{"text":"그러고","x":1318,"y":507,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"나서","x":1437,"y":508,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"수신","x":1518,"y":510,"width":69,"height":37},{"text":"측에서","x":1602,"y":511,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"각","x":1721,"y":511,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트","x":1769,"y":512,"width":130,"height":40}]},{"text":"는 분할된 데이터그램들로 재구성되어야 한다.","words":[{"text":"는","x":571,"y":569,"width":35,"height":35},{"text":"분할된","x":618,"y":567,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"데이터그램들로","x":735,"y":567,"width":235,"height":38},{"text":"재구성되어야","x":984,"y":566,"width":205,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":1201,"y":567,"width":75,"height":38}]},{"text":"공격받는 네트워크","words":[{"text":"공격받는","x":723,"y":747,"width":212,"height":56},{"text":"네트워크","x":949,"y":748,"width":210,"height":56}]},{"text":"오늘날 인터넷은 그고 작은 회사, 대학, 그리고 정부기관 등을 포함하는 많은 기관들에","words":[{"text":"오늘날","x":562,"y":873,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"인터넷은","x":680,"y":873,"width":136,"height":39},{"text":"그고","x":828,"y":879,"width":68,"height":26},{"text":"작은","x":908,"y":873,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"회사,","x":991,"y":873,"width":75,"height":38},{"text":"대학,","x":1082,"y":874,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"그리고","x":1172,"y":875,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"정부기관","x":1291,"y":876,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"등을","x":1443,"y":878,"width":71,"height":36},{"text":"포함하는","x":1528,"y":878,"width":141,"height":37},{"text":"많은","x":1682,"y":879,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"기관들에","x":1767,"y":879,"width":127,"height":43}]},{"text":"게 매우 중요한 것이 되었다. 또한 많은 개인들도 그들의 직업적, 사회적, 그리고 개인","words":[{"text":"게","x":563,"y":934,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"매우","x":609,"y":934,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"중요한","x":691,"y":935,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"것이","x":810,"y":935,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"되었다.","x":891,"y":934,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"또한","x":1017,"y":935,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"많은","x":1099,"y":935,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"개인들도","x":1184,"y":935,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"그들의","x":1335,"y":937,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"직업적,","x":1457,"y":937,"width":112,"height":38},{"text":"사회적,","x":1586,"y":938,"width":113,"height":38},{"text":"그리고","x":1716,"y":939,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"개인","x":1834,"y":941,"width":61,"height":40}]},{"text":"적 활동에 있어 인터넷에 의존하고 있다. 웨어러블과 홈 장치들을 포함하는 수억 개의","words":[{"text":"적","x":563,"y":995,"width":27,"height":38},{"text":"활동에","x":607,"y":995,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"있어","x":727,"y":995,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"인터넷에","x":809,"y":995,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"의존하고","x":958,"y":995,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1111,"y":995,"width":73,"height":39},{"text":"웨어러블과","x":1202,"y":996,"width":175,"height":39},{"text":"홈","x":1390,"y":998,"width":35,"height":37},{"text":"장치들을","x":1439,"y":998,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"포함하는","x":1595,"y":998,"width":142,"height":37},{"text":"수억","x":1750,"y":1000,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"개의","x":1834,"y":1001,"width":59,"height":42}]},{"text":"“시물들”이 현재 인터넷에 연결되고 있다. 그러나 이러한 모든 유용성과 역동성 뒤에,","words":[{"text":"“시물들”이","x":560,"y":1057,"width":161,"height":38},{"text":"현재","x":739,"y":1057,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"인터넷에","x":825,"y":1056,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"연결되고","x":977,"y":1056,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1129,"y":1056,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"그러나","x":1220,"y":1057,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"이러한","x":1342,"y":1058,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"모든","x":1461,"y":1060,"width":71,"height":35},{"text":"유용성과","x":1547,"y":1059,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"역동성","x":1707,"y":1059,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"뒤에,","x":1824,"y":1061,"width":71,"height":43}]},{"text":"“나쁜 친구들”이 인터넷에 연결된 컴퓨터에 해를 끼치고, 사생활을 침해하고, 우리가","words":[{"text":"“나쁜","x":559,"y":1119,"width":83,"height":38},{"text":"친구들”이","x":659,"y":1118,"width":145,"height":38},{"text":"인터넷에","x":827,"y":1117,"width":131,"height":39},{"text":"연결된","x":980,"y":1118,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"컴퓨터에","x":1100,"y":1118,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"해를","x":1253,"y":1118,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"끼치고,","x":1341,"y":1119,"width":111,"height":38},{"text":"사생활을","x":1471,"y":1119,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"침해하고,","x":1632,"y":1120,"width":147,"height":39},{"text":"우리가","x":1797,"y":1121,"width":99,"height":43}]},{"text":"의존하는 인터넷 서비스를 동직하지 못하게 함으로써 우리의 일상생활을 망가트리려","words":[{"text":"의존하는","x":560,"y":1180,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"인터넷","x":713,"y":1179,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"서비스를","x":830,"y"